[{"title":"复过常州承李太守罗二守饯于毗陵驿中","author":"罗钦顺","text":"薰风醉我毗陵驿，高树阴浓鸟缓啼。\n但使客来醇酒在，不妨曹相卧临齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗二守复携酒送至新闸","author":"罗钦顺","text":"云树十年多少事，画船尊酒故须深。\n那堪又作匆匆别，明日今宵两地心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复过丹阳阻浅久之方脱","author":"罗钦顺","text":"平生行路喜迟迟，耐得如今阁浅时。\n似有高人骑骏马，也曾清昼陷深池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复过镇江","author":"罗钦顺","text":"城兼山势两崔嵬，池受江潮日往来。\n和雨和烟瓜埠柳，隔江犹解映楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过扬州","author":"罗钦顺","text":"两两三三听事人，陶然都是醉乡民。\n黄昏点鼓移舟去，扬子湾头月似银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邵伯","author":"罗钦顺","text":"闻说去年湖水汎，旧痕依约半柴扉。\n今年一饱天公赐，处处牛车刈麦归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发高邮","author":"罗钦顺","text":"湖气连城雨未收，行边多是打鱼舟。\n因何换得农官做，添著湖田万顷秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次淮阴","author":"罗钦顺","text":"漂母祠前起夕阴，隔江渔艇对孤吟。\n干戈满眼诸公在，合有千金一饭心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"借得公馆养疴","author":"罗钦顺","text":"拟借禅林暂托居，偶临公馆更清虚。\n门前尽日无车马，一味薰风养病躯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公馆即事","author":"罗钦顺","text":"庭前高树欲凌云，扰扰昏鸦漫作群。\n明月满天人已静，数声犹向梦中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内子生朝","author":"罗钦顺","text":"花吐高葵日正长，草深幽砌独焚香。\n浮生苦被虚名累，仍向天涯忆孟光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读桂进士兄弟文字喜而赋之","author":"罗钦顺","text":"坐久香风断续过，入心文字不嫌多。\n还寻䆳密深沈句，他日重逢奈若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复过广陵道中","author":"罗钦顺","text":"一梦迎銮已十年，再来心迹总依然。\n疏帘复对青山捲，谁信看山独有缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"借居三塔庵","author":"罗钦顺","text":"野寺萧条一老僧，粥铛茶灶煮枯藤。\n夜窗对我浑无语，俄去堂前供佛灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连日客至","author":"罗钦顺","text":"庭草朝来满意青，屐痕交处便凋零。\n从前不是逢迎懒，恐误诸公伴独醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送魏良辅秀才还新建 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"万木边江叶尽稀，玉人初抱五经归。\n悬知后夜趋庭梦，长共孤云断续飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送魏良辅秀才还新建 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"客路风霜日夜严，行装携去几重毡。\n丁宁莫怕寒侵骨，耐得寒时骨更坚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送魏良辅秀才还新建 其三","author":"罗钦顺","text":"千里琴书入故村，朋来何惜酒频温。\n也应问讯村南北，兵后耕牛几具存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送魏良辅秀才还新建 其四","author":"罗钦顺","text":"鸡鸣山下小斋幽，曾讶明珠暗里投。\n千古斯文期共学，科场容易出人头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵荅守庵叔父 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"百年诗酒乐时雍，清比梅花劲比松。\n长忆桥门联上寿，举觞惟愿福来崇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵荅守庵叔父 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"官寺原因地势高，宦情常苦送迎劳。\n何如伴赏东林竹，笑把银黄等一毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵奉寄西阜叔父 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"初度曾经匕箸雍，坐看西阜长高松。\n簟瓢陋巷诗千首，身自居贫德自崇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵奉寄西阜叔父 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"仕路崎岖不出高，有心那得为人劳。\n细签大押干何事，枉费山中万兔毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵奉寄寿官伯父 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"翩翩飞鹭满西雍，老鹤相依只涧松。\n高岸乌纱摩醉眼，救时勋业付姚崇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵奉寄寿官伯父 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"四峰骈耸一峰高，好景长牵客梦劳。\n拙宦有年无寸补，何如赢取伯成毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连被公荐不果用士夫有见慰者因赋短章 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"朝朝无事也升堂，退坐寒斋日正长。\n大学中庸频料理，不知身外有轩裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连被公荐不果用士夫有见慰者因赋短章 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"江汉秋风日夜清，一壶聊对菊花倾。\n人心自有光明处，变化无端是五行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连被公荐不果用士夫有见慰者因赋短章 其三","author":"罗钦顺","text":"伊洛渊源世所宗，高谈性理半雷同。\n若无上蔡除根力，远隔程门一万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧生循威为余写真复作小影传其家因题一绝","author":"罗钦顺","text":"循威运笔有家风，能与衰颜借壮容。\n十载江湖心事苦，不知多少见眉峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送三坳宗侄邦团 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"朝耕暮读承家早，冀北滇南识路多。\n数酌金陵官舍酒，醉来词气亦平和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送三坳宗侄邦团 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"吾宗子弟森森在，爱尔清年颇自强。\n勤俭两言行到底，管教门户日辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送求古叔还乡 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"薰风一棹入秦淮，为惜多年出处乖。\n官舍晚烟人吏散，灯前觞咏两开怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送求古叔还乡 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"家庭肃穆团三从，肝胆轮囷总一身。\n况是早年曾共学，缊袍那羡锦衣新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送求古叔还乡 其三","author":"罗钦顺","text":"平生经义千篇在，老去心情七字能。\n得丧饱经知有命，当杯何惜醉腾腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送求古叔还乡 其四","author":"罗钦顺","text":"两月清谈未觉穷，归装何事复匆匆。\n匡时愧我浑无术，怅望东林旧竹丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴白楼重修清风亭有述次韵 其一","author":"罗钦顺","text":"重把柔荑葺旧椽，楣间珠贝复齐编。\n清风暂作颂台主，黄阁还公未老年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴白楼重修清风亭有述次韵 其二","author":"罗钦顺","text":"竹色青疑上采椽，蓊阴凉可玩遗编。\n诗成每向花前酌，酌到梅花又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd