"text":"山馆停车坐夕阳，芭蕉新叶过檐长。\n吾心已觉浑无事，是处安身总不妨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"罗钦顺","text":"黏天秋水净无瑕，极目东南感慨赊。\n心体本来包四海，相如词赋为谁誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次鸭栏驿对岸","author":"罗钦顺","text":"断山偃蹇卧中流，山下平铺一片洲。\n茅屋人家生理薄，酒帘斜拂钓鱼舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次鱼山驿","author":"罗钦顺","text":"断堤疏柳簇茅庐，土著无多半客居。\n谁似李家兄与弟，共将名字显嘉鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行即事","author":"罗钦顺","text":"秋晚江湖渐落槽，两涯曾架逐场高。\n低田水泛常艰食，鲜食堪求若惮劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过牌洲驿","author":"罗钦顺","text":"地平山迥渺洪流，西啮东吞得自由。\n道是牌洲须记取，驿楼仍在水中浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望金口","author":"罗钦顺","text":"早泛扁舟阅二梁，山川形胜忆兴王。\n宁知此日过金口，眼界虽同志未偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至金口登高一望","author":"罗钦顺","text":"生受舆夫踏草茅，登临何止助风骚。\n残山点点浮鹅鸭，阻截狂澜恨不高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次汉阳","author":"罗钦顺","text":"汉阳城下暂停舟，江树湖云一片秋。\n千古神功存大别，隔江黄鹤亦高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次蔡店驿","author":"罗钦顺","text":"一饭行行两舍交，饥来仍念仆夫劳。\n驿楼已近泥途隔，笑指厨烟上柳梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过汉川县","author":"罗钦顺","text":"一峰圆耸映湖明，却借川名表县名。\n城市萧条官吏少，鹄袍犹喜见诸生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次刘家隔","author":"罗钦顺","text":"复渚重湖接汉川，刘家名隔是何年。\n南来北去寻常事，树杪风帆后或前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次应城县","author":"罗钦顺","text":"舣舟湖岸路初平，野色苍茫入应城。\n中道不堪风雨恶，燎衣犹自到天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至德安驻城南金泉寺","author":"罗钦顺","text":"环寺山重竹树稠，绕城江曲净含秋。\n僧家亦有奔忙日，只为征骖一夜留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿府免见遣官来赐羊酒","author":"罗钦顺","text":"灵光伊迩愧尘容，肥羜芳樽礼意浓。\n因忆先皇虞蜀险，爱深同气此移封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中见野菊盛开有感","author":"罗钦顺","text":"荻篱黄菊手亲栽，预拟清香溢寿杯。\n庭献迹遥怜野摘，马头三嗅独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次应山","author":"罗钦顺","text":"远山崷崒近坡陀，千室深藏宛一窝。\n莫道窝中无胜槩，须知平地有风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过恨这关","author":"罗钦顺","text":"恨这关头一问名，浪传先主恨难平。\n居民却有无穷恨，家落黄巾半死生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次闷城公馆","author":"罗钦顺","text":"重门深院小廊偏，茗椀薰炉坐有毡。\n犹忆荆湖山色好，望穷来路渺云烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次信阳州","author":"罗钦顺","text":"野树萧疏见女墙，沙滩清浅竞褰裳。\n城中宦达知多少，曾向南宫识二良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次明港公馆","author":"罗钦顺","text":"午饭长亭已渡淮，夕阳明港坐空斋。\n盘飧复自官厨出，一饱应惭始愿乖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次确山","author":"罗钦顺","text":"几辈酣嬉老太平，儿孙辛苦筑坚城。\n西山不管人间事，长向秋空阁晚晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日确山早发见菊花有感","author":"罗钦顺","text":"客里重阳也自佳，山城初日见黄花。\n遥知仲季娱亲处，应念驱驰驿路赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次遂平","author":"罗钦顺","text":"诗兴多应似确山，不堪重叠叙艰难。\n环城树色青青在，休把安心托抱关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过西平","author":"罗钦顺","text":"片片秋田总过犁，满原晴色树高低。\n欲从父老诹生聚，清昼无缘驻马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次郾城","author":"罗钦顺","text":"渡口孤舟往复频，两行灯火入重闉。\n途长马瘦饥僮仆，橐有馀粮旋觅薪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过临颍","author":"罗钦顺","text":"颍水趋淮日夜流，几经名县又名州。\n悬知润及都蒙福，远近无烦子细求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15178,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次许州","author":"罗钦顺","text":"麦田微绿柿林丹，丰岁从知合境安。\n闻道德星浑未识，不辞深夜倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15179,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过长葛","author":"罗钦顺","text":"一番朝雨净浮埃，长葛云林望里开。\n风动轻帷如有意，好山东面送青来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15180,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]